WEBVTT

00:01.970 --> 00:06.470
Some important person is 
coming to meet me? What for?

00:06.840 --> 00:11.690
Although His Majesty already held 
a banquet for royalty and nobility,

00:11.690 --> 00:14.280
not all those invited were able to attend.

00:14.700 --> 00:19.460
One of those who could not now craves 
an audience with you, Lady Sariphi.

00:19.770 --> 00:21.730
Really? That's nice.

00:21.730 --> 00:24.660
I'm glad there's someone who wants to meet me.

00:25.110 --> 00:28.120
You cannot afford to take 
this matter so lightly.

00:29.330 --> 00:35.390
You must play host to this distinguished 
guest as mistress of the palace.

00:35.640 --> 00:40.100
I propose to make this one of your 
ordeals on the path to queenship.

00:41.220 --> 00:43.990
And the name of this visitor is...

00:44.470 --> 00:46.480
What?!

00:47.000 --> 00:51.190
D-Duke Galois?! D-Do you mean <i>the</i> Duke Galois?!

00:51.190 --> 00:52.620
You know him?

00:52.620 --> 00:57.340
Of course. We've never met in person,

00:57.340 --> 01:01.700
but he's a legendary general with 
numerous feats of arms to his name.

01:02.080 --> 01:04.350
In particular, he is undefeated on the sea.

01:04.350 --> 01:09.190
His ruthless tactics there earned him 
the nickname "Galois the Sea God."

01:10.520 --> 01:16.010
And rumor has it that Duke Galois 
hates humans with a passion.

01:16.010 --> 01:19.020
If you were to rub him the wrong way,

01:19.380 --> 01:21.710
he would surely make you regret it!

02:52.020 --> 02:57.030
The Sea God and the Second Ordeal

02:57.370 --> 03:00.980
You certainly have a devious mind.

03:01.350 --> 03:07.080
Setting the famously cantankerous 
Duke Galois against her is quite a stroke.

03:07.350 --> 03:11.710
His Grace requested the audience. 
I pulled no strings.

03:11.710 --> 03:15.380
But she'll have much to prepare.

03:15.380 --> 03:21.080
Making the human lady host a ball 
is practically inviting her to blunder.

03:21.080 --> 03:27.360
Did you believe I was honestly trying 
to gauge the wench's potential?

03:27.960 --> 03:31.440
Her existence will be 
His Majesty's death someday.

03:31.440 --> 03:35.680
I must eliminate her at any cost 
before that happens.

03:35.930 --> 03:38.770
And I trust you haven't forgotten

03:39.450 --> 03:41.860
that we swore to defend 
His Majesty together—

03:41.860 --> 03:46.200
I as his brain, and you as his sword.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.430
Of course not.

03:47.430 --> 03:49.620
Then mind your own business.

03:49.970 --> 03:54.870
I will find His Majesty a fitting consort, 
and a human is out of the question.

03:55.160 --> 03:56.220
Really?

03:56.960 --> 04:00.160
Are you sure you wouldn't oppose 
<i>any</i> match he made, Abi?

04:04.270 --> 04:05.580
Tell me, sire,

04:05.940 --> 04:09.240
is Duke Galois really that scary?

04:09.240 --> 04:11.760
I've never met him in person, either.

04:11.760 --> 04:12.850
However,

04:13.250 --> 04:17.380
he has ruthlessly subjugated 
brigands and enemies of the state.

04:17.380 --> 04:19.390
If something displeases him,

04:19.390 --> 04:22.590
I don't doubt that he would even turn 
his sword against me, his king.

04:23.270 --> 04:28.020
But whatever Galois says, 
I won't let him lay a hand on you.

04:28.280 --> 04:34.490
To protect you, I would become 
a truly terrifying man myself.

04:36.450 --> 04:39.960
Then I'll do my very best, sire.

04:40.380 --> 04:42.220
So you won't have to make scary faces.

05:02.490 --> 05:04.830
H-He's finally here.

05:04.830 --> 05:07.080
That's the dreaded Sea God...

05:07.350 --> 05:09.260
Duke Galois.

05:10.370 --> 05:12.480
We have been expecting Your Grace.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.740
I am Anubis, His Majesty's chancellor.

05:14.980 --> 05:19.120
It is an honor to make the acquaintance 
of the renowned Duke Gal—

05:19.120 --> 05:21.570
Don't waste my time on pleasantries!

05:21.570 --> 05:24.010
Bring out the king's favorite.

05:24.950 --> 05:27.010
I beg your pardon, sir.

05:27.010 --> 05:29.760
Kindly wait a moment, 
and she will join us presently.

05:31.100 --> 05:32.980
Who do you think you are?

05:32.980 --> 05:34.770
My Lord Chancellor.

05:35.420 --> 05:39.250
My master presents this gift to His Majesty.

05:39.550 --> 05:43.020
Istanese wine, aged for 300 years.

05:44.740 --> 05:47.270
My, what a splendid vintage.

05:47.610 --> 05:49.430
You there, take charge of it.

05:49.430 --> 05:50.670
O-Of course.

05:52.470 --> 05:53.990
<i>What a fishy stench.</i>

05:54.700 --> 05:57.160
<i>Especially from this fellow.</i>

05:57.660 --> 06:03.430
<i>The Ichthyans are a hideous race, 
although not quite so unseemly as humans.</i>

06:03.960 --> 06:05.670
Thank you for waiting.

06:06.830 --> 06:10.420
Welcome, Your Grace.

06:11.020 --> 06:17.070
I am Sariphi, and I will serve 
as your hostess for today.

06:17.420 --> 06:20.820
What?! What's the big idea?!

06:20.820 --> 06:21.370
Pardon?

06:21.650 --> 06:23.890
I'm asking you whose idea of a joke this is!

06:23.890 --> 06:28.510
Look at her! You expect me to believe 
a <i>human</i> could be queen?!

06:28.510 --> 06:30.730
If this is supposed to be funny, I'm leaving!

06:31.000 --> 06:33.200
Your Grace, please be calm.

06:33.200 --> 06:35.290
At least hear what His Majesty has to say.

06:35.770 --> 06:38.910
You think you can give <i>me</i> orders?

06:40.670 --> 06:41.940
Silence.

06:42.720 --> 06:46.040
I will permit no disturbances 
in this sacred palace.

06:46.380 --> 06:48.840
It is a pleasure to make 
Your Majesty's acquaintance.

06:48.840 --> 06:51.570
Galois, Duke of Istan at your service.

06:51.570 --> 06:55.530
There can be no greater honor than 
to stand in your royal presence.

06:55.530 --> 06:57.900
Or that's what I would say,

06:58.170 --> 07:00.880
but even a king can only 
get away with so much.

07:00.880 --> 07:03.310
And making me the butt of this bad joke...

07:03.310 --> 07:05.560
There are no jokes here.

07:05.920 --> 07:10.230
Sariphi is my one and only future queen.

07:10.230 --> 07:16.620
With all due respect, lowly human scum 
doesn't strike me as royal wife material.

07:16.620 --> 07:17.860
You dare?!

07:17.860 --> 07:19.360
Your Grace, Duke Galois.

07:20.680 --> 07:23.940
A human queen would be 
unprecedented, I know.

07:23.940 --> 07:26.600
I understand your feelings of trepidation.

07:26.900 --> 07:27.800
However,

07:27.800 --> 07:32.210
please witness that we 
are entirely in earnest

07:32.500 --> 07:34.330
with Your Grace's own eyes.

07:37.700 --> 07:41.150
This building plays host to 
many rituals and festivities.

07:41.150 --> 07:44.350
Only select guests of royal and 
noble blood are entertained here.

07:45.120 --> 07:46.260
Please step this way.

07:46.820 --> 07:49.760
I was nervous for a moment there.

07:48.730 --> 07:50.780
<b>CHEAT SHEET</b>

07:49.760 --> 07:54.520
Good thing we planned for Duke Galois's 
reaction when we wrote the script.

07:54.520 --> 07:55.740
Close one.

07:55.740 --> 08:00.810
And all her hard work seems 
to be paying off beautifully!

08:00.810 --> 08:04.880
This venerable courtyard boasts 
a history spanning two millennia.

08:05.640 --> 08:09.330
It has survived the long ages and been 
loved by many distinguished guests.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.930
<b></b>BLANK

08:11.310 --> 08:13.140
Um...

08:13.140 --> 08:15.100
<i>She forgot her lines!</i>

08:16.050 --> 08:17.910
I thought so.

08:17.910 --> 08:21.480
You just memorized a bunch of facts 
to make yourself look smart.

08:21.480 --> 08:26.320
For the scrawny, bungling creatures you are, 
you humans are wily indeed!

08:26.320 --> 08:28.670
You can't be trusted!

08:28.670 --> 08:30.230
You disgust me! I've seen enough!

08:30.530 --> 08:32.910
Hurry up and skip to dinner.

08:33.650 --> 08:37.320
<i>If only he'd decided to leave, 
this would all be over.</i>

08:37.800 --> 08:38.650
<i>But no matter.</i>

08:38.980 --> 08:41.510
<i>I can strike as many sparks as necessary.</i>

08:42.030 --> 08:47.120
Now, let us toast to His Grace's 
valor and this wonderful day.

08:51.110 --> 08:56.760
Why has our hostess, who led the toast, 
not so much as touched her cup?

08:56.760 --> 09:00.260
Can't you drink the wine I presented?

09:00.480 --> 09:02.700
Our humble apologies, Your Grace.

09:02.700 --> 09:06.750
The Lady Sariphi claims that 
beast wine disagrees with her.

09:06.750 --> 09:07.520
What?!

09:07.820 --> 09:09.470
Y-You misunderstand.

09:09.470 --> 09:12.150
It's not that Sari <i>won't</i> drink. She <i>can't</i>.

09:12.150 --> 09:17.330
What does that matter? A queen who 
can't drink a toast is no queen at all.

09:17.330 --> 09:20.550
This is why you can't count 
on humans for anything!

09:20.860 --> 09:24.030
Your Grace, we are at the table. 
Please restrain your—

09:24.030 --> 09:25.310
Quiet!

09:25.310 --> 09:29.620
How many times must I tell you 
to leave me when I'm eating?

09:29.620 --> 09:33.770
Looking at your ugly mug makes 
everything taste rotten.

09:33.770 --> 09:34.970
You shouldn't talk to him like—

09:34.970 --> 09:36.300
The same goes for you!

09:36.520 --> 09:40.870
Who could eat with a <i>human</i> 
staring them in the face?!

09:40.870 --> 09:43.350
Get out of here! Now!

09:44.630 --> 09:45.930
Sire...

09:46.300 --> 09:51.320
I beg your pardon, sir. 
I will excuse myself.

09:51.880 --> 09:56.850
I hope that you will all enjoy 
this meal at your leisure.

09:57.290 --> 09:58.650
Sari...

10:12.370 --> 10:14.220
I'm so hungry.

10:16.290 --> 10:18.140
Cy? Clops?

10:18.140 --> 10:20.990
Thank you! Just what I needed!

10:22.040 --> 10:23.220
Sire?

10:24.670 --> 10:27.150
Don't tell me this is <i>your</i> food?

10:27.150 --> 10:30.120
Yours was taken away.

10:30.440 --> 10:32.980
Then you haven't eaten anything?

10:33.350 --> 10:39.760
Dining across from a man who insults 
my queen would spoil any dish.

10:41.560 --> 10:43.060
What's so amusing?

10:43.060 --> 10:45.090
Nothing. It's not funny at all.

10:45.090 --> 10:46.290
Thank you.

10:46.620 --> 10:50.630
And don't worry about me. 
I've gotten used to things like this.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.540
But—

10:51.820 --> 10:54.830
I can't leave His Grace in a 
foul temper like this, can I?

10:55.390 --> 10:58.120
I'd better turn things around 
at the ball tonight.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.690
Right?

11:00.800 --> 11:02.050
<i>Sariphi...</i>

11:02.460 --> 11:06.760
<i>You truly are far stronger 
than the likes of me.</i>

11:07.240 --> 11:09.620
Come on, sire. Have some, too.

11:09.620 --> 11:11.710
I'm already stuffed.

11:11.710 --> 11:13.980
No, I'll have some of this.

11:15.780 --> 11:19.530
You won't turn anything around 
with a dirty mouth.

11:20.640 --> 11:28.090
Show him. Show <i>all</i> of them 
that I was right to choose you.

11:29.100 --> 11:29.850
I will.

11:36.970 --> 11:40.040
Will Lady Sariphi be all right?

11:40.040 --> 11:43.960
Of course she will. You know 
how much she practiced dancing.

11:43.960 --> 11:45.100
Sari worked hard.

11:47.610 --> 11:48.650
Your Grace,

11:49.230 --> 11:52.020
may I have this dance?

11:52.750 --> 11:54.250
No.

12:01.820 --> 12:03.530
Didn't you hear me?

12:03.530 --> 12:05.680
I said no.

12:05.680 --> 12:08.780
You expect the mighty Galois to dance 
hand-in-hand with a human?

12:09.010 --> 12:10.540
O-Oh, no!

12:10.540 --> 12:12.370
Then what about Sari's ordeal?

12:13.320 --> 12:16.280
Ordeal? What ordeal?

12:16.280 --> 12:17.260
Chancellor!

12:17.430 --> 12:23.800
You see, sir, if the Lady Sariphi cannot 
play hostess to an honored guest,

12:23.800 --> 12:27.510
she will be removed from 
consideration as our future queen.

12:27.510 --> 12:28.950
Anubis!

12:28.950 --> 12:30.530
I beg your pardon, sire.

12:31.180 --> 12:35.580
That said, if you, sir, as the 
guest of honor, were to withdraw,

12:35.580 --> 12:38.810
this ball would be canceled.

12:38.810 --> 12:41.580
No, that would be no fun.

12:41.580 --> 12:46.020
My servant here will dance 
with the human in my place.

12:46.320 --> 12:51.650
Watching two ugly freaks join hands 
should be worth a laugh.

12:53.110 --> 12:55.840
If she doesn't like it, 
she can always refuse.

13:20.660 --> 13:23.700
I beg your pardon, human miss.

13:23.700 --> 13:27.480
For making you dance with 
an old dodderer like me.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.320
What?

13:28.660 --> 13:33.490
My fire-scarred skin sheds 
its scales and reeks of rot.

13:33.490 --> 13:36.700
What a hideous and dreadful 
sight I must make.

13:37.180 --> 13:39.920
Not at all. Why do you say so?

13:40.240 --> 13:45.850
You grimaced and hesitated 
when you first took my hand.

13:46.400 --> 13:49.380
That's because you look like 
you must be in so much pain.

13:50.500 --> 13:53.230
These old wounds don't hurt me.

13:53.230 --> 13:54.440
Really?

13:54.440 --> 13:58.590
I received most of them over a 
century ago, in the last war.

13:59.470 --> 14:04.490
These hands have slain 
many foes—many humans.

14:04.490 --> 14:09.320
In revenge, I was burnt at human hands.

14:09.940 --> 14:13.030
Do you hate humans, too, then?

14:13.030 --> 14:16.280
Who can say? War is like that.

14:16.850 --> 14:18.250
The gulf is deep.

14:18.620 --> 14:20.980
And if you, a human, 
become queen of this realm,

14:20.980 --> 14:26.230
you'll need to grapple with that 
truth to the end of your days.

14:26.230 --> 14:28.890
Why would you choose such a thorny path?

14:30.100 --> 14:34.610
I just... want to be at His Majesty's side.

14:35.480 --> 14:40.490
A human like me can only 
live here thanks to him.

14:41.360 --> 14:45.890
<i>The king has two faces: beast and human.</i>

14:45.890 --> 14:48.770
<i>I want him to be able 
to go on living as he is.</i>

14:49.360 --> 14:54.380
I don't have any power of my own, 
but I want to help him in any way I can.

14:54.790 --> 15:00.030
Well, then, I suppose you've 
fallen in love with His Majesty.

15:00.280 --> 15:04.140
Huh? In love with... His Majesty...

15:05.770 --> 15:10.330
Silly me. We old-timers love 
to meddle in youngsters' business.

15:12.710 --> 15:15.130
It looks like they're 
talking about something.

15:15.130 --> 15:17.070
They seem to be enjoying themselves.

15:18.550 --> 15:19.950
Tell me, Grandpa.

15:19.950 --> 15:21.760
G-Grandpa?

15:21.760 --> 15:24.600
If you're not in pain, 
could I squeeze a little harder?

15:25.000 --> 15:27.760
It's harder to dance if we 
aren't really holding hands.

15:28.260 --> 15:28.970
Here.

15:28.970 --> 15:30.720
Whoa, there!

15:30.720 --> 15:33.890
Here, now. Go easy twirling 
my old bones around.

15:33.890 --> 15:36.250
Oh, I'm so sorry.

15:42.390 --> 15:44.780
What're you laughing for?!

15:44.780 --> 15:49.430
There's no fun in watching you 
make friends with a human!

15:49.800 --> 15:51.830
You disgrace to the Ichthyan race!

15:55.510 --> 15:59.720
What's this, wench? 
Are you trying to shield him?

15:59.720 --> 16:01.590
Move! You're in my way!

16:02.740 --> 16:03.730
I will not.

16:04.000 --> 16:05.310
Lady Sariphi...

16:05.310 --> 16:06.820
Don't give me that.

16:07.150 --> 16:09.720
This is Ichthyan business.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.690
Keep your nose out of it, human!

16:11.690 --> 16:13.050
Now, move!

16:14.040 --> 16:15.100
I will not.

16:16.070 --> 16:19.000
Y-You little idiot.

16:19.000 --> 16:23.800
You'll never be a legitimate queen 
if you fail this "ordeal" of yours.

16:24.030 --> 16:27.550
I hold your fate in my hands.

16:27.840 --> 16:32.010
Leave it be, miss. You mustn't 
argue with His Grace.

16:32.240 --> 16:35.970
Don't mind me. I'm used to this.

16:35.970 --> 16:38.780
That's the wisdom of age speaking.

16:38.780 --> 16:44.040
Only a fool loses sight of the big picture 
to feel like a hero for a moment.

16:44.040 --> 16:47.990
Either way, you're not queen material!

16:48.430 --> 16:53.870
Now, choose. Make the smart 
choice for your future,

16:53.870 --> 16:57.330
or destroy yourself for 
that old bag of bones.

16:57.560 --> 16:59.270
Well?

17:00.220 --> 17:01.360
Sari...

17:02.930 --> 17:07.030
<i>Sariphi, I believe in you.</i>

17:07.850 --> 17:09.560
<i>And in the choice you'll make.</i>

17:10.700 --> 17:11.790
Sire,

17:13.120 --> 17:18.270
I'm sorry. It looks like I can't 
be your queen after all.

17:19.200 --> 17:21.120
I... I don't believe it!

17:21.120 --> 17:26.820
You'd give up power and status 
just to shield this one old wretch?!

17:27.110 --> 17:29.140
He's right. Let it go.

17:29.450 --> 17:30.910
Remember what you told me?

17:30.910 --> 17:33.980
You want to stand by the king to support him.

17:33.980 --> 17:35.140
So you should—

17:35.140 --> 17:36.310
That's why I'm doing this.

17:37.320 --> 17:43.950
If I became queen like this, I'd still 
have to leave His Majesty someday.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.580
I want...

17:46.090 --> 17:50.380
to become someone who can stand 
by his side with her head held high.

17:50.920 --> 17:58.000
Otherwise, I won't be able to share his 
vision of a future where no one gets hurt.

17:59.500 --> 18:03.800
If a queen is someone who ignores 
someone being hurt right in front of her,

18:04.180 --> 18:06.170
then I could never be a queen.

18:07.890 --> 18:10.140
Is that your answer?

18:10.500 --> 18:12.400
Yes, it is, Mr. Shark.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.400
Mister—

18:13.400 --> 18:15.140
Who do you think you're talk—

18:15.140 --> 18:18.080
You lash out at people who can't fight back,

18:18.080 --> 18:20.580
and you still call yourself a great warrior?

18:20.580 --> 18:21.570
Sh-Shut yo—

18:21.570 --> 18:23.870
Are you <i>really</i> the Sea God?

18:25.210 --> 18:26.960
<i>I thought as much. This man is...</i>

18:34.420 --> 18:36.680
Stop. You've done enough.

18:36.930 --> 18:38.930
He stopped the duke's sword with one hand?!

18:41.010 --> 18:41.760
Huh?

18:44.140 --> 18:46.060
Has this farce reached its end,

18:46.660 --> 18:49.800
Galois the Sea God, Duke of Istan?

18:50.140 --> 18:51.100
What?

18:51.100 --> 18:52.400
Duke Galois?!

18:52.400 --> 18:53.530
This old man?!

18:53.530 --> 18:54.660
It can't be...

18:55.190 --> 18:57.930
Why did you carry out this plot?

18:58.520 --> 19:06.010
We Ichthyans endured ill treatment 
under the reigns of our previous kings.

19:06.010 --> 19:08.790
Since Your Majesty's succession, however,

19:08.790 --> 19:12.920
times have begun to change, albeit gradually.

19:13.160 --> 19:16.050
You are a light in the dark to us, sire.

19:16.050 --> 19:22.440
But we came here because we heard 
talk that you had become deranged,

19:22.440 --> 19:28.040
and that you intended to take 
a queen unfit for royal dignity.

19:28.560 --> 19:33.430
Then, to test Sariphi, you had 
your man play the tyrant

19:33.430 --> 19:36.690
and disguised yourself as an old 
soldier fallen on hard times?

19:37.010 --> 19:39.370
It is as you say, sire.

19:39.370 --> 19:42.200
I came prepared to face any punishment.

19:42.200 --> 19:45.270
But first, permit me to say one thing.

19:45.270 --> 19:48.500
What insolence! Haven't you said enough?!

19:49.020 --> 19:50.380
Speak.

19:50.780 --> 19:55.750
This entire deception was practiced 
at my sole discretion.

19:55.750 --> 19:59.770
All of my men merely obeyed orders.

19:59.770 --> 20:04.840
Please, sire, take my head 
alone to sate your anger!

20:05.590 --> 20:07.020
I beseech you!

20:11.490 --> 20:13.190
Hold it right there!

20:13.500 --> 20:16.280
That ain't what we signed up fer, pops!

20:16.280 --> 20:19.750
Ya never said anythin' about 
takin' all the blame on yerself!

20:19.750 --> 20:20.870
Joz?!

20:22.500 --> 20:26.500
Please, sire! If ya want a head, take mine!

20:26.820 --> 20:29.400
Pops is like a lighthouse ta us.

20:29.400 --> 20:32.190
None of us can get by without him.

20:32.530 --> 20:39.480
I know my head ain't worth much, 
but I'm willing ta die fer him!

20:40.220 --> 20:42.380
What are you doing?! Remove him!

20:42.380 --> 20:45.260
W-We're trying, but he's too strong!

20:45.760 --> 20:49.930
You really care about Grandpa, don't you?

20:51.680 --> 20:54.690
Then you shouldn't talk about dying.

20:56.170 --> 20:59.980
Tell me, sire, do we really 
need to punish them?

20:59.980 --> 21:02.860
I mean, I'm not hurt or anything.

21:03.540 --> 21:07.780
A-Ain'tcha mad?! 
I said a lotta awful stuff ta ya!

21:08.330 --> 21:10.720
But you didn't mean it, did you?

21:10.720 --> 21:14.620
It doesn't bother me. And I had a lot of fun.

21:15.360 --> 21:21.830
No. Deceiving me, the king, and insulting 
my beloved is a grave offense.

21:21.830 --> 21:24.720
I will not be satisfied until I have 
imposed a fitting punishment.

21:26.520 --> 21:31.220
Galois, Duke of Istan, and Joz, 
Supreme Commander of the Istanese Navy,

21:31.220 --> 21:35.040
and all other Ichthyans 
involved in this affair:

21:36.290 --> 21:39.620
Swear perpetual allegiance to me!

21:39.620 --> 21:43.870
Give your all to defend my realm for my sake!

21:48.070 --> 21:51.500
Thank you for this 
magnanimous sentence, sire.

21:51.840 --> 21:53.990
Henceforth, we Ichthyans

21:53.990 --> 21:59.490
swear everlasting loyalty and reverence 
to Your Most August Majesty.

21:59.710 --> 22:00.760
And...

22:00.760 --> 22:07.420
to support the Lady Sariphi, 
your lawful consort and our future queen.

22:08.300 --> 22:11.870
Next time, I'll teach ya ta swim!

22:15.910 --> 22:17.630
I'm sorry, sire.

22:17.940 --> 22:20.230
I acted selfishly again.

22:20.820 --> 22:24.200
It looks like I can't be your queen after all.

22:25.350 --> 22:31.820
True. If possible, I wish to never 
hear such words pass your lips again.

22:33.530 --> 22:38.400
I have been prepared since the moment 
I chose to make you my queen.

22:38.910 --> 22:43.370
Trampling on others to save 
yourself is not in your nature.

22:44.500 --> 22:47.420
I had faith in your answer.

22:47.700 --> 22:52.940
It is because you give such answers 
that I wish to make you my queen

22:53.260 --> 22:55.440
and my wife.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.430
<i>His wife...</i>

23:02.770 --> 23:04.690
Sire? Where are we going?

23:05.070 --> 23:06.760
Your chamber is the other way.

23:08.800 --> 23:10.900
This is where we held the ball.

23:11.760 --> 23:12.650
Sariphi.

23:13.810 --> 23:16.620
May I have this dance?

23:26.070 --> 23:28.070
Curse you, human wench!

23:28.070 --> 23:30.720
You've even twisted Duke Galois 
around your finger!

23:30.720 --> 23:32.650
The time for niceties has passed!

23:32.650 --> 23:36.770
I must remove her from 
the king's side at any cost!

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Next Episode

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Recollections of a King and His Chancellor

23:37.340 --> 23:39.840
From <i>my</i> king's side.
